ing. Those are also concerns but perhaps less severe. So we might still support A, but we could suggest we need more info on stress. Could propose to gather more info before final decision. But we must give a recommendation now. We can maintain A, but note the need for further evidence. Or we could shift to B as a safer bet on stress resilience. However B's nasty remarks could affect crew cooperation severely. I'd stay with A.\n\nThus public message: I agree with Agent 1, still recommend A, but emphasize need for stress data, maybe propose to get reference check. Provide reasoning.\n\nMetadata vote: Candidate A.\n\nProceed."}
